  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project to Support Private Sector Development through Investment Promotion</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Proyecto de Apoyo al Desarrollo del Sector Privado va la Promocin de las Inversiones</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general es contribuir al incremento de la Inversin Extranjera Directa. El objetivo especfico busca aumentar del nmero de empresas extranjeras que toman la decisin de localizarseexpandir en Hait gracias al apoyo tcnico del CFI.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective is to contribute to the increase of Direct Foreign Investment. The specific objective seeks to increase the number of foreign companies that take the decision to locate  expand in Haiti thanks to the technical support of the CFI.</narrative>
  </description>
